{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"9","type":"text","text":"## BaseAgent 主执行循环\n\n**文件**：`BaseAgent.java` 第282-336行\n\n### run() 方法 - 智能体主控制器\n```java\npublic AgentExecResult run() {\n    currentStep = 0;\n    List<AgentExecResult> results = new ArrayList<>();\n    \n    try {\n        // 主执行循环 - 最多执行maxSteps次\n        while (currentStep < maxSteps) {\n            currentStep++;\n            log.info(\"执行第 {}/{} 轮\", currentStep, maxSteps);\n            \n            // 调用子类的step()方法（ReActAgent.step()）\n            AgentExecResult stepResult = step();\n            \n            // 检查执行状态\n            AgentState stepState = stepResult.getState();\n            if (stepState == COMPLETED || stepState == INTERRUPTED || stepState == FAILED) {\n                // 根据状态进行不同处理\n                if (stepState == INTERRUPTED) {\n                    handleInterruptedExecution(results);\n                } else if (stepState == FAILED) {\n                    handleFailedExecution(results);\n                } else {\n                    handleCompletedExecution(results);\n                }\n                break;  // 终止循环\n            }\n            \n            results.add(stepResult);  // 保存执行结果\n        }\n        \n        // 处理达到最大步数的情况\n        if (currentStep >= maxSteps && !isTerminalState(lastStepResult)) {\n            String finalSummary = generateFinalSummary();\n            lastStepResult = new AgentExecResult(terminateWithSummary(finalSummary), AgentState.COMPLETED);\n        }\n        \n    } catch (Exception e) {\n        return handleUnexpectedException(e);\n    }\n    \n    return lastStepResult;\n}\n```\n\n**设计亮点**：\n- **循环控制**: 最多maxSteps次，防止无限循环\n- **结果保存**: 每步结果都保存，支持断点续传\n- **状态检查**: 根据AgentState决定是否继续\n- **优雅终止**: 达到最大步数时生成摘要并完成","x":-2360,"y":470,"width":880,"height":1410,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"1","type/":"text","text":"# ReAct Think-Act 循环机制\n\n## 核心设计哲学\n- ReAct = Reasoning + Acting（推理 + 行动）\n- 像人类专家一样：分析情况 → 制定计划 → 执行行动 → 重新评估\n- 渐进式执行，每步都可观察和控制\n\n## 三个核心类的继承关系\n- BaseAgent（抽象基类）：提供状态管理和执行框架\n- ReActAgent（抽象类）：实现Think-Act循环模式\n- DynamicAgent（具体实现）：完整的智能体实现","type":"text","x":-1239,"y":-2480,"width":530,"height":400,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"5","type":"text","text":"## BaseAgent 状态管理机制\n\n### 6种状态枚举\n**文件**：`AgentState.java`\n```java\npublic enum AgentState {\n    NOT_STARTED(\"not_started\"),     // 未开始\n    IN_PROGRESS(\"in_progress\"),     // 执行中\n    COMPLETED(\"completed\"),         // 已完成\n    BLOCKED(\"blocked\"),             // 被阻塞\n    FAILED(\"failed\"),               // 执行失败\n    INTERRUPTED(\"interrupted\")      // 用户中断\n}\n```\n\n### 状态转换逻辑\n```java\n// BaseAgent.run() 方法第298-316行\nif (stepState == AgentState.COMPLETED || \n    stepState == AgentState.INTERRUPTED ||\n    stepState == AgentState.FAILED) {\n    \n    // 根据状态进行不同处理\n    if (stepState == AgentState.INTERRUPTED) {\n        handleInterruptedExecution(results);\n    } else if (stepState == AgentState.FAILED) {\n        handleFailedExecution(results);\n    } else {\n        handleCompletedExecution(results);\n    }\n    break;\n}\n```\n\n**业务意义**：\n- 区分用户主动中断（INTERRUPTED）和系统错误（FAILED）\n- 保存执行进度，支持断点续传\n- 不同状态有不同的资源清理策略","x":-2880,"y":-1030,"width":520,"height":1000,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"2","type":"text","text":"## 1. BaseAgent - 抽象基类\n\n**位置**：`src/main/java/com/alibaba/cloud/ai/manus/agent/BaseAgent.java`\n\n**核心职责**：\n- 状态管理（6种状态）\n- 执行循环控制\n- 异常处理框架\n- 资源管理\n\n**关键字段**：\n- `AgentState state` - 智能体当前状态\n- `int maxSteps` - 最大执行步数限制\n- `int currentStep` - 当前步数计数器\n- `List<AgentExecResult> results` - 执行结果历史\n\n**关键抽象方法**：\n- `getName()` - 获取智能体名称\n- `getDescription()` - 获取描述\n- `step()` - 执行单步（核心抽象）\n- `clearUp()` - 资源清理","x":-1286,"y":-1760,"width":625,"height":590,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"3","type":"text","text":"## 2. ReActAgent - Think-Act模式\n\n**位置**：`src/main/java/com/alibaba/cloud/ai/manus/agent/ReActAgent.java`\n\n**核心职责**：\n- 实现Think-Act循环模式\n- 定义推理和行动的抽象接口\n- 继承BaseAgent的所有状态管理能力\n\n**核心设计**：\n```java\npublic abstract class ReActAgent extends BaseAgent\n```\n\n**关键抽象方法**：\n- `think()` - 执行思考过程，返回boolean决定是否需要行动\n- `act()` - 执行具体行动，返回AgentExecResult\n\n**step()方法实现**：\n```java\npublic AgentExecResult step() {\n    boolean shouldAct = think();  // 思考阶段\n    if (!shouldAct) {\n        return \"思考完成 - 无需采取行动\";\n    }\n    return act();  // 行动阶段\n}\n```","x":-1300,"y":-880,"width":647,"height":700,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"6","type":"text","text":"## ReActAgent Think-Act 循环\n\n### 核心循环逻辑\n**文件**：`ReActAgent.java` 第87-106行\n\n```java\n@Override\npublic AgentExecResult step() {\n    try {\n        // Step 1: 思考阶段 - 让LLM分析当前情况\n        boolean shouldAct = think();\n        \n        if (!shouldAct) {\n            // LLM认为当前任务完成，无需更多行动\n            return new AgentExecResult(\n                \"Thinking complete - no action needed\",\n                AgentState.IN_PROGRESS\n            );\n        }\n        \n        // Step 2: 行动阶段 - 执行LLM决定的工具调用\n        return act();\n        \n    } catch (TaskInterruptedException e) {\n        // 用户中断处理\n        return new AgentExecResult(\n            \"Agent execution interrupted: \" + e.getMessage(),\n            AgentState.INTERRUPTED\n        );\n    }\n}\n```\n\n**业务逻辑**：\n1. **think()**: 让LLM分析当前环境，决定是否需要执行工具\n2. **act()**: 如果think()返回true，执行LLM选择的工具\n3. **返回状态**: 根据执行结果更新智能体状态","x":-1287,"y":470,"width":625,"height":930,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"10","type":"text","text":"## 完整任务执行流程图\n\n### 用户任务：「分析销售数据并生成报告」\n\n```\n。  用户请求\n      ↓\nBaseAgent.run() 开始\n      ↓\n┌─────────────────────────────────┐\n│     第1轮 Think-Act 循环         │\n├─────────────────────────────────┤\n│ think(): LLM分析：               │\n│ \"用户要销售报告，但无数据\"          │\n│ \"需要先读取数据库\"                 │\n│ → return true                   │\n│ ↓                               │\n│ act(): 执行 database_read_use    │\n│ 参数: {table: \"sales\"}           │\n│ → 返回销售数据                    │\n│ → 状态: IN_PROGRESS              │\n└─────────────────────────────────┘\n       ↓\n┌─────────────────────────────────┐\n│     第2轮 Think-Act 循环         │\n├─────────────────────────────────┤\n│ think(): LLM分析：               │\n│ \"已获得数据，需要生成报告\"          │\n│ \"调用文件操作工具\"                 │\n│ → return true                   │\n│ ↓                               │\n│ act(): 执行 local_file_operator  │\n│ 创建报告文件                      │\n│ → 返回文件路径                    │\n│ → 状态: IN_PROGRESS              │\n└─────────────────────────────────┘\n       ↓\n┌─────────────────────────────────┐\n│     第3轮 Think-Act 循环         │\n├─────────────────────────────────┤\n│ think(): LLM分析：               │\n│ \"报告已生成，任务完成\"             │\n│ → return false                  │\n│ ↓                               │\n│ return \"Thinking complete\"      │\n│ → 状态: IN_PROGRESS              │\n└─────────────────────────────────┘\n       ↓\n┌─────────────────────────────────┐\n│     第4轮 Think-Act 循环         │\n├─────────────────────────────────┤\n│ think(): LLM分析：               │\n│ \"调用 TerminateTool 终止任务\"     │\n│ → return true                   │\n│ ↓                               │\n│ act(): 执行 TerminateTool        │\n│ → 状态: COMPLETED                │\n└─────────────────────────────────┘\n       ↓\nBaseAgent.run() 检测到COMPLETED状态\n调用 handleCompletedExecution()\n返回最终结果给用户\n```","x":-1182,"y":2480,"width":415,"height":1520,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"11","type":"text","text":"## 关键设计模式分析\n\n### 1. 模板方法模式\n**位置**: BaseAgent.run() + ReActAgent.step()\n\n```java\n// BaseAgent 定义算法骨架\npublic AgentExecResult run() {\n    while (currentStep < maxSteps) {\n        AgentExecResult stepResult = step();  // 调用子类实现\n        if (isTerminalState(stepResult.getState())) {\n            handleTerminalState(stepResult);  // 模板方法\n            break;\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n// ReActAgent 实现具体步骤\npublic AgentExecResult step() {\n    boolean shouldAct = think();  // 子类实现\n    return shouldAct ? act() : \"Thinking complete\";\n}\n```\n\n### 2. 策略模式\n**位置**: DynamicAgent.processSingleTool() vs processMultipleTools()\n\n```java\n// 根据工具数量选择不同执行策略\nif (toolCalls.size() == 1) {\n    return processSingleTool(toolCalls.get(0));     // 单工具策略\n} else {\n    return processMultipleTools(toolCalls);         // 多工具并行策略\n}\n```\n\n### 3. 状态模式\n**位置**: AgentState + 状态处理方法\n\n```java\n// 不同状态有不同的处理逻辑\nif (stepState == AgentState.INTERRUPTED) {\n    handleInterruptedExecution(results);  // 中断处理策略\n} else if (stepState == AgentState.FAILED) {\n    handleFailedExecution(results);       // 失败处理策略\n} else {\n    handleCompletedExecution(results);    // 完成处理策略\n}\n```\n\n### 4. 重试模式\n**位置**: DynamicAgent.executeWithRetry()\n\n```java\n// 最多重试3次LLM调用\nwhile (attempt < maxRetries) {\n    try {\n        return executeLlmCall();  // 执行LLM调用\n    } catch (Exception e) {\n        recordException(e);       // 记录异常\n        if (attempt == maxRetries) {\n            return false;         // 重试失败\n        }\n    }\n}\n```","x":125,"y":2418,"width":635,"height":1645,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"12","type":"text","text":"## 错误处理和恢复机制\n\n### 1. 多层次异常处理\n\n**BaseAgent层** - 系统级异常\n```java\n// BaseAgent.run() 第322行\ncatch (Exception e) {\n    log.error(\"智能体执行出现未预期异常\", e);\n    return new AgentExecResult(\"System error: \" + e.getMessage(), AgentState.FAILED);\n}\n```\n\n**ReActAgent层** - 任务中断处理\n```java\n// ReActAgent.step() 第102行\ncatch (TaskInterruptedException e) {\n    return new AgentExecResult(\"Agent execution interrupted: \" + e.getMessage(), AgentState.INTERRUPTED);\n}\n```\n\n**DynamicAgent层** - LLM调用异常处理\n```java\n// DynamicAgent.executeWithRetry()\ncatch (Exception e) {\n    llmCallExceptions.add(e);     // 记录异常供后续分析\n    latestLlmException = e;      // 保存最新异常\n    \n    if (attempt == maxRetries) {\n        return false;             // 重试失败，但智能体继续运行\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 2. 智能重试机制\n\n**LLM调用重试**: 最多3次\n**位置**: DynamicAgent.executeWithRetry() 第379行\n\n```java\nprivate boolean executeWithRetry(int maxRetries) {\n    int attempt = 0;\n    while (attempt < maxRetries) {\n        try {\n            // 每次重试前检查中断\n            checkInterruptionAndContinue();\n            \n            // 清理之前的异常记录\n            llmCallExceptions.clear();\n            latestLlmException = null;\n            \n            // 执行LLM调用\n            return performLlmCall();\n            \n        } catch (Exception e) {\n            attempt++;\n            if (attempt >= maxRetries) {\n                // 重试用尽，记录失败但不终止智能体\n                latestLlmException = e;\n                return false;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. 优雅降级策略\n\n**LLM调用失败时的处理**:\n```java\n// DynamicAgent 第600-609行\nif (latestLlmException != null) {\n    log.error(\"智能体{}思考失败，使用系统错误报告工具模拟流程\", getName());\n    return handleLlmTimeoutWithSystemErrorReport();\n}\n```\n\n**工具执行失败时的处理**:\n```java\n// DynamicAgent 第716-725行\ncatch (Exception e) {\n    log.error(\"工具执行错误: {}\", e.getMessage(), e);\n    \n    // 返回错误信息但保持智能体运行\n    return new AgentExecResult(\n        \"Error executing tools: \" + e.getMessage(), \n        AgentState.IN_PROGRESS  // 注意：不是FAILED\n    );\n}\n```","x":1370,"y":2152,"width":800,"height":2177,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"13","type":"text","text":"## 🧠 核心记忆点（30秒回顾）\n\n### 1. 三层继承关系\n```\nBaseAgent (框架层)\n    ↓ 提供状态管理、执行循环、异常处理\nReActAgent (模式层) \n    ↓ 实现Think-Act循环模式\nDynamicAgent (实现层)\n    ↓ 具体的LLM调用和工具执行\n```\n\n### 2. Think-Act 核心循环\n```\nwhile (currentStep < maxSteps) {\n    boolean shouldAct = think();  // LLM分析，决定是否行动\n    if (shouldAct) {\n        act();                     // 执行LLM选择的工具\n    } else {\n        // 思考完成，但任务可能还未结束\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. 关键状态转换\n- **IN_PROGRESS → COMPLETED**: TerminateTool被调用\n- **IN_PROGRESS → INTERRUPTED**: 用户主动中断\n- **IN_PROGRESS → FAILED**: 系统级错误无法恢复\n\n### 4. 核心价值\n- ✅ **渐进式执行**：每步都可观察和控制\n- ✅ **智能错误恢复**：区分用户中断和系统错误\n- ✅ **断点续传**：执行进度保存，支持恢复\n- ✅ **企业级设计**：多层次异常处理，优雅降级\n\n### 5. 关键文件路径\n- **BaseAgent**: `src/main/java/.../BaseAgent.java`\n- **ReActAgent**: `src/main/java/.../ReActAgent.java`  \n- **DynamicAgent**: `src/main/java/.../DynamicAgent.java`","x":2800,"y":2682,"width":720,"height":1117,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"4","type":"text","text":"## 3. DynamicAgent - 具体实现\n\n**位置**：`src/main/java/com/alibaba/cloud/ai/manus/agent/DynamicAgent.java`\n\n**核心职责**：\n- 完整实现think()和act()方法\n- 集成LLM服务进行智能决策\n- 支持多种工具执行（单工具/多工具）\n- 实现重试机制和错误恢复\n\n**关键特性**：\n- 3次重试机制\n- 流式响应处理\n- 中断检查支持\n- 工具执行路由\n\n**关键字段**：\n- `LlmService llmService` - LLM调用服务\n- `PlanExecutionRecorder planExecutionRecorder` - 执行记录器\n- `ChatResponse streamResult` - LLM响应结果\n- `List<Exception> llmCallExceptions` - 异常记录","x":720,"y":-840,"width":600,"height":620,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"15","type":"text","text":"## DynamicAgent think() 具体实现\n\n**文件**：`DynamicAgent.java` 第379-500行\n\n### executeWithRetry() 核心逻辑\n```java\nprivate boolean executeWithRetry(int maxRetries) throws Exception {\n    // 清理异常记录\n    llmCallExceptions.clear();\n    latestLlmException = null;\n    \n    while (attempt < maxRetries) {\n        // 1️⃣ 中断检查\n        checkInterruptionAndContinue();\n        \n        try {\n            // 2️⃣ 构建LLM输入消息\n            Message systemMessage = getThinkMessage();              // 系统提示\n            Message envMessage = currentStepEnvMessage();           // 当前环境\n            \n            // 3️⃣ 加载历史记忆\n            ChatMemory memory = llmService.getAgentMemory(maxMemory);\n            List<Message> history = memory.get(getCurrentPlanId());\n            \n            // 4️⃣ 构建完整消息序列\n            List<Message> messages = new ArrayList<>();\n            messages.add(systemMessage);     // 系统提示\n            messages.addAll(history);        // 历史对话\n            messages.add(envMessage);        // 当前环境\n            \n            // 5️⃣ 配置调用选项\n            String toolcallId = planIdDispatcher.generateToolCallId();\n            ToolCallingChatOptions chatOptions = ToolCallingChatOptions.builder()\n                .internalToolExecutionEnabled(false)\n                .toolContext(Map.of(\"toolcallId\", toolcallId, \"planDepth\", getPlanDepth()))\n                .build();\n            \n            // 6️⃣ 调用LLM进行思考\n            Prompt userPrompt = new Prompt(messages, chatOptions);\n            List<ToolCallback> callbacks = getToolCallList();\n            ChatClient chatClient = llmService.getDynamicAgentChatClient(modelName);\n            \n            // 7️⃣ 流式响应处理\n            Flux<ChatResponse> responseFlux = chatClient.prompt(userPrompt)\n                .toolCallbacks(callbacks)\n                .stream()\n                .chatResponse();\n                \n            // 8️⃣ 处理流式响应\n            streamResult = streamingResponseHandler.processStreamingResponse(\n                responseFlux, \"Agent \" + getName() + \" thinking\", getCurrentPlanId(), isDebugModel, true);\n            \n            // 9️⃣ 分析LLM决策\n            List<ToolCall> toolCalls = streamResult.getEffectiveToolCalls();\n            String responseText = streamResult.getEffectiveText();\n            \n            log.info(\"✨ {}'s thoughts: {}\", getName(), responseText);\n            log.info(\"🛠️ {} selected {} tools to use\", getName(), toolCalls.size());\n            \n            // 🔟 工具存在检查\n            if (!toolCalls.isEmpty()) {\n                // 记录思考-行动过程\n                recordThinkingAndAction(toolCalls, thinkInput, responseText);\n                \n                // 如果是重试成功，清除异常缓存\n                if (attempt > 1) {\n                    clearExceptionCache();\n                }\n                \n                return true;  // 成功，需要执行工具\n            }\n            \n            // 无工具选择，准备重试\n            log.warn(\"Attempt {}: No tools selected. Retrying...\", attempt);\n            \n        } catch (Exception e) {\n            // 记录异常，继续重试\n            llmCallExceptions.add(e);\n            lastException = e;\n            \n            if (attempt >= maxRetries) {\n                latestLlmException = e;\n                throw e;  // 重试用尽，抛出异常\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    \n    return false;  // 所有重试都失败，无需行动\n}\n```\n\n### 关键设计细节\n\n**🧠 消息构建策略**:\n```java\n// 消息顺序很重要！\nList<Message> messages = List.of(\n    systemMessage,    // 1. 角色定义和任务说明\n    ...history,        // 2. 历史对话上下文\n    envMessage         // 3. 当前环境和状态\n);\n```\n\n**🔄 流式响应处理**:\n- 使用 `streamingResponseHandler` 处理长响应\n- 支持内容合并和早期终止\n- 提供更好的用户体验\n\n**📝 思考过程记录**:\n```java\n// 完整的Think-Act记录\nThinkActRecordParams params = new ThinkActRecordParams(\n    thinkActId,        // 唯一标识\n    stepId,            // 步骤ID  \n    thinkInput,        // 输入消息\n    responseByLLm,     // LLM思考内容\n    null,              // 行动结果（act()后填充）\n    actToolInfoList    // 选中的工具列表\n);\nplanExecutionRecorder.recordThinkingAndAction(step, params);\n```\n\n**💡 智能重试策略**:\n- 最多重试3次\n- 每次重试前检查中断\n- 异常累积记录\n- 成功后清除缓存","x":1990,"y":-3960,"width":970,"height":3120,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"c3feb5d31f90459d","x":3877,"y":-2143,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"4","type":"text","text":"act()详细实现"},
		{"id":"8","type":"text","text":"## DynamicAgent act() 方法详解\n\n**文件**：`DynamicAgent.java` 第692-725行\n\n### 核心行动流程\n```java\nprotected AgentExecResult act() {\n    // 1. 中断检查\n    if (!agentInterruptionHelper.checkInterruptionAndContinue()) {\n        return new AgentExecResult(\"Action interrupted by user\", AgentState.INTERRUPTED);\n    }\n    \n    try {\n        // 2. 获取LLM决定的工具调用\n        List<ToolCall> toolCalls = streamResult.getEffectiveToolCalls();\n        \n        // 3. 根据工具数量路由执行\n        if (toolCalls.isEmpty()) {\n            return new AgentExecResult(\"tool call is empty, please retry\", AgentState.IN_PROGRESS);\n        } else if (toolCalls.size() == 1) {\n            return processSingleTool(toolCalls.get(0));     // 单工具执行\n        } else {\n            return processMultipleTools(toolCalls);         // 多工具并行执行\n        }\n        \n    } catch (Exception e) {\n        // 4. 错误处理\n        return handleToolExecutionError(e);\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### processSingleTool 核心逻辑\n**文件**：`DynamicAgent.java` 第740-830行\n\n```java\nprivate AgentExecResult processSingleTool(ToolCall toolCall) {\n    String toolName = toolCall.function().name();\n    Map<String, Object> arguments = toolCall.function().arguments();\n    \n    // 记录工具调用信息\n    actToolInfoList.add(new ActToolInfo(toolName, arguments));\n    planExecutionRecorder.recordThinkingAndAction(step, actToolInfoList);\n    \n    // 特殊工具处理\n    if (toolName.equals(\"TerminateTool\")) {\n        return new AgentExecResult(\"Task completed successfully\", AgentState.COMPLETED);\n    }\n    \n    // 执行具体工具\n    ToolCallback callback = getToolCallBackContext(toolName);\n    String result = callback.apply(arguments);\n    \n    // 判断是否应该终止\n    boolean shouldTerminate = shouldTerminateBasedOnResult(result);\n    AgentState state = shouldTerminate ? AgentState.COMPLETED : AgentState.IN_PROGRESS;\n    \n    return new AgentExecResult(result, state);\n}\n```\n\n**业务逻辑**：\n- **工具解析**: 从LLM响应中提取工具名称和参数\n- **工具路由**: 根据工具数量选择单工具或多工具处理\n- **执行记录**: 记录每个工具调用，支持审计和调试\n- **状态更新**: 根据执行结果更新智能体状态","x":2100,"y":-80,"width":940,"height":1660,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"14","type":"text","text":"## 🔄 完整调用流程图\n\n### 动态执行路径可视化\n\n```\n🎯 用户发起任务\n    ↓\n📋 BaseAgent.run() [主控制器]\n    ├─ currentStep = 0\n    ├─ results = new ArrayList<>()\n    └─ maxSteps = 配置限制\n    ↓\n🔄 while (currentStep < maxSteps) 循环开始\n    ↓\n🎭 ReActAgent.step() [Think-Act循环]\n    ↓\n🤔 DynamicAgent.think() [思考阶段]\n    ├─ 1️⃣ 中断检查\n    ├─ 2️⃣ 环境数据准备\n    ├─ 3️⃣ executeWithRetry(3)\n    │  ├─ 构建消息: system + history + environment\n    │  ├─ llmService.call() → ChatResponse\n    │  ├─ streamResult = response [保存供act使用]\n    │  └─ return response.hasToolCalls()\n    ↓\n🔀 决策分支\n    ├─ ✅ shouldAct = true → 去行动阶段\n    └─ ❌ shouldAct = false → 返回 \"Thinking complete\"\n    ↓\n⚡ DynamicAgent.act() [行动阶段]  \n    ├─ 1️⃣ 中断检查\n    ├─ 2️⃣ 获取工具: streamResult.getEffectiveToolCalls()\n    ├─ 3️⃣ 路由决策:\n    │  ├─ 无工具 → 返回错误，重试\n    │  ├─ 1个工具 → processSingleTool()\n    │  └─ 多个工具 → processMultipleTools()\n    └─ 4️⃣ 执行工具 → 返回结果 + 状态\n    ↓\n📊 状态检查 (BaseAgent.run())\n    ├─ AgentState.COMPLETED → handleCompletedExecution() ✅\n    ├─ AgentState.INTERRUPTED → handleInterruptedExecution() 🛑\n    ├─ AgentState.FAILED → handleFailedExecution() ❌\n    └─ AgentState.IN_PROGRESS → 继续下一轮循环 🔄\n    ↓\n📝 结果保存\n    ├─ results.add(stepResult)\n    ├─ planExecutionRecorder.record()\n    └─ currentStep++\n    ↓\n🔁 回到循环开始\n```\n\n### 关键数据流转\n\n**🧠 think() → act() 数据传递**:\n```java\n// think() 保存LLM响应\nstreamResult = llmService.call(messages);\n\n// act() 使用保存的响应\nList<ToolCall> toolCalls = streamResult.getEffectiveToolCalls();\n```\n\n**📊 循环结果累积**:\n```java\n// BaseAgent.run()\nList<AgentExecResult> results = new ArrayList<>();\nwhile (currentStep < maxSteps) {\n    AgentExecResult stepResult = step();\n    results.add(stepResult);  // 每步结果都被保存\n}\n```\n\n**⚡ 状态管理流转**:\n```\nNOT_STARTED → IN_PROGRESS → (思考/行动循环)\n    ↓\n    ├─ COMPLETED (TerminaterTool)\n    ├─ INTERRUPTED (用户取消)\n    ├─ FAILED (系统错误)\n    └─ IN_PROGRESS (继续下一轮)\n```\n\n**🔄 记忆系统维护**:\n```java\n// 每次LLM调用都使用历史记忆\nChatMemory memory = llmService.getAgentMemory();\nList<Message> history = memory.get(getCurrentPlanId());\n\n// 执行后更新记忆\nplanExecutionRecorder.recordThinkingAndAction(step, actToolInfoList);\n```","x":4480,"y":-1620,"width":675,"height":2180,"color":"4"}
	],
